## Breakfast, then the market

The Albert Cuypmarkt starts a couple of minutes from the front door and runs the length of the street. Cheese, flowers, fabric, fish, and stroopwafels pressed while you wait. Go before eleven if you would rather browse than queue, then work your way back through the side streets for coffee.

